                                                                      style="animation-name: o_anim_zoom_in; animation-play-state: running; visibility: visible;">THE INSTITUTION.....</span></h3>
                                                            <p>
                                                                St. Eugene CBSE School is scheduled to begin its first academic session in June 2027. It is an English-medium, co-educational institution established and administered by [Name of Trust / Society - SEC-TODO], and it follows the curriculum prescribed by the Central Board of Secondary Education, New Delhi.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                The school admits children of all castes, creeds and communities. Preparation for the first session is under way across three fronts at once: completing the campus and its laboratories, recruiting and training the founding teaching team, and finalising the academic plan for the primary years.
                                                            </p>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="align-self-stretch s_media_list_img_wrapper col-lg-6">
                                                            <img src="/web_editor/image_shape/website.s_media_list_default_image_1/web_editor/composition/composition_square_1.svg?c1=o-color-4&amp;c2=o-color-2"
