                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Instruction is in English throughout. The course of study prepares students for the examinations of the Central Board of Secondary Education, New Delhi, with Tamil and Hindi offered as second and third languages.
                                                    </p>
