                                                                      style="animation-name: o_anim_zoom_in; animation-play-state: running; visibility: visible;">OUR MANAGEMENT.....</span></h3>
                                                            <p>
                                                                The school is governed by a Management Committee constituted in accordance with CBSE norms. It comprises the President, the Vice-President, the Secretary, the Correspondent and the Principal, together with parent and teacher representatives who join once the first session begins.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                The Committee is the deciding body of the school. It sets academic policy, approves the budget and fee structure, oversees staff appointments, and takes final responsibility for all matters concerning St. Eugene CBSE School.
                                                            </p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Our founding teaching team is being recruited now, and we are deliberately taking our time over it. We are looking for teachers who are strong in their subject, patient with children, and genuinely interested in building something from the beginning. Every appointee goes through a structured CBSE orientation programme before the session opens.
                                                        <br></br>
                                                        <br></br>
                                                        Parents are partners in this, not spectators. From the first term we will run regular parent-teacher meetings, an open-door policy for concerns, and a parent representative seat on the Management Committee.
                                                    </p>
                                                </div>
