                                                                      style="animation-name: o_anim_zoom_in; animation-play-state: running; visibility: visible;">AIM AND OBJECTIVES.....</span></h3>
                                                            <p>
                                                                <b>Our Vision.</b> To be a school where children are taught to think clearly, act honestly and care about people beyond themselves - and where academic excellence is the result of that upbringing rather than a substitute for it.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <b>Our Mission.</b> To give every student a sound education and a settled sense of discipline built on moral principles; to draw out each child's individual strengths instead of ranking them against one another; and to send out young people who are confident, sincere and useful members of society.


                                                            </p>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="align-self-stretch s_media_list_img_wrapper col-lg-6">
                                                            <img src="/web_editor/image_shape/website.s_media_list_default_image_1/web_editor/composition/composition_square_1.svg?c1=o-color-4&amp;c2=o-color-2"
                                                                class="s_media_list_img h-100 w-100" alt="" data-shape="web_editor/composition/composition_square_1" data-original-mimetype="image/jpeg"
                                                                data-file-name="s_media_list_1.svg" data-shape-colors="o-color-4;o-color-2;;;" loading="lazy" data-original-id="235"
                                                                data-original-src="/theme_anelusia/static/src/img/snippets/s_media_list_1.jpg" data-mimetype="image/svg+xml" style=""></img>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <p>
                                                        <b>Our Objectives.</b> To build a strong foundation in language, mathematics, science and social understanding through the CBSE curriculum. To make enquiry, reading and discussion normal classroom habits rather than exam-time exercises. To give sport, music, art and public speaking real time in the timetable, not leftover time. To keep classes small enough that no child goes unnoticed. And to hold up the values of respect, honesty, peace, justice and fellowship as things we practise, not merely display.
                                                    </p>
                                                </div>
<!--                                            </div>-->
