                                                            <p>
                                                                Applications are now open for our founding batch, joining in <b>June 2027</b>.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <b>Classes offered in the first session:</b> LKG, UKG and Classes I to V.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <b>Age as on 31 March 2027:</b> LKG - 3+ years; UKG - 4+ years; Class I - 5+ years.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <b>Medium of instruction:</b> English. <b>Board:</b> CBSE, New Delhi.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <b>Seats:</b> limited, to keep the founding classes small.
                                                            </p>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="align-self-stretch s_media_list_img_wrapper col-lg-6">
                                                            <img src="/web_editor/image_shape/website.s_media_list_default_image_1/web_editor/composition/composition_square_1.svg?c1=o-color-4&amp;c2=o-color-2"
                                                                class="s_media_list_img h-100 w-100" alt="" data-shape="web_editor/composition/composition_square_1" data-original-mimetype="image/jpeg"
                                                                data-file-name="s_media_list_1.svg" data-shape-colors="o-color-4;o-color-2;;;" loading="lazy" data-original-id="235"
                                                                data-original-src="/theme_anelusia/static/src/img/snippets/s_media_list_1.jpg" data-mimetype="image/svg+xml" style=""></img>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <p>
                                                        <b>Indicative admission timeline.</b> Applications open - September 2026. Campus open days for parents - November 2026. Parent interaction and registration - January 2027. First list of selected students - February 2027. Fee payment and confirmation - March 2027. Orientation for new parents - May 2027. First academic session begins - June 2027.
                                                        <br></br>
                                                        <br></br>
                                                        There is no written test for entry to the primary classes; admission is by a short, informal interaction with the child and parents. To apply, use the <a href="/applyonline">online application form</a>, or contact the school office at [Phone - SEC-TODO] or [Email - SEC-TODO]. Dates are indicative and will be confirmed on this page before applications open.
                                                    </p>
